WEBVTT

00:30:58.162 --> 00:31:00.799
I'll go back to an idea
we earlier discussed:

00:31:00.823 --> 00:31:02.902
the neighborhood is the unit of change.

00:31:02.926 --> 00:31:05.774
So the sin of slavery,
the sin of discrimination,

00:31:05.798 --> 00:31:08.314
is not just an individual sin,
it's a national sin.

00:31:08.338 --> 00:31:11.511
It's a sin that radiates outwards
and affects all sorts of things

00:31:11.535 --> 00:31:13.011
across our society.

00:31:13.035 --> 00:31:15.537
And tough measures
have to be taken against that sin.

00:31:15.561 --> 00:31:18.929
I've recently been convinced
that reparations is the right policy

00:31:18.953 --> 00:31:22.737
as a way to really dive into
and acknowledge that sinfulness,

00:31:22.761 --> 00:31:27.313
really, as a sign of respect to those
who have suffered under that.

00:31:27.337 --> 00:31:30.319
CA: Wow, well, coming from you,
that will surprise some people.